# The Holy Crest (sandoria 93): the level guards. A WAR 29 with ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 29: Arminibit's literal 30 refuses
# (587), Ceraulian's setting admits (24, TheHolyCrest_Event 1). Then ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 30 (a GM's setting): Ceraulian
# refuses too (no arm; Knight Stalker none: 587).
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=0.6,-8,-121.9 job=WAR lvl=29
setting ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 29
login
trigger Arminibit                         # level 29 (below the literal 30): no arm: 587
finish
trigger Ceraulian                         # level 29, ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 29, available: 24
finish                                    # TheHolyCrest_Event 1
setting ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL 30
trigger Ceraulian                         # level 29 below 30: no arm; Knight Stalker none: 587
finish
